Error [E0003]: a `??` fallback cannot be a bare block
  --> tests/ui/qq_block_fallback.jet:3:25
    |
  3 |     value :: maybe() ?? {
    |                         ^
 Why: `??` accepts one fallback value or a control action, not a block with several steps
 Fix: write `value ?? fallback`, `value ?? return`, or `value ?? make_fallback()`
